Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.61,0:00:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面说点火开关保险丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says the ignition switch fuse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.89,0:00:06.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在27号位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}is found at location number 27.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:08.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  27号  我得知道那在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, 27. I need to know where that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:15.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这个坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, this one's blown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个红色的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this one, the red one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸妈  我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, Dad, we got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快点  快点  -我们看见它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, come on. - We see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:27.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得找到保险丝来发动车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need to find a fuse so we can start the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:29.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就快找到了  亲爱的  6号位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost got it, honey. Location six.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:31.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里有转向灯和刹车灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's turn signal lamps and stop lamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.95,0:00:34.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有转向灯也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we can live without turn signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:35.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸  它们来...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, they're com--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(西芹汤)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西芹汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Celery soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放在这里一直没人要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been here since the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望辣椒粉能掩盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm hoping the paprika will mask
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:26.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汤里的西芹味\N{\fnArial\fs30}the soup's celeryness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就会做出一碗辣椒粉汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'd be stuck with something that tastes like paprika.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:30.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是不要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想着既然我们的主食不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I just figured since we're running low on staples,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:36.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想用一些没人想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd try to use a few things nobody seems to want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前会给爱德做春季大扫荡砂锅菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to make Ed these spring cleaning casseroles
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是为了清空储藏室\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to empty the pantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我靠荸荠制造过奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made some miracles happen with water chestnuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说到奇迹  可乐罐头火腿的食谱真了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about miracles, that recipe for cola canned ham.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,佩尔蒂埃太太  你真是个大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Peletier, you are an honest to goodness hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么问题吗  谢莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong, Shelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是一些老面条\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just those old noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:09.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人给我找到一台机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}if someone would just find me one of those machines,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓我们会大吃特吃意面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear we would all be eating like we were on a tour of Tuscany.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.89,0:07:17.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小谢  我可以教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Shel, I could teach you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么用双手做意面\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to make pasta with your own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得保证别在房子里抽烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'd have to promise not to smoke in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.87,0:07:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个令人讨厌的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a disgusting habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.83,0:07:26.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且会害死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it kills you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.03,0:07:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我说  已经有太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask me, there are too many things
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:30.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想害死你的东西了  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to do that already, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸以前打你  然后他被人杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad used to hit you and then he got himself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事发生了  别多想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened. Now it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:51.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要么接受这一点  要么被打垮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live with it or it eats you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.87,0:08:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:21.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you come down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:40.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-罗恩  -不  我不想剪头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ron. - No, I don't want a haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  我刚给自己剪了  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I just gave myself one. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:48.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东西都摆好了  别逼我下周再摆一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all set up. Don't make me do it again next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.62,0:08:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摘下你的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这太扯了  -你说什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is bullshit. - What did you just--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:55.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不过是想和我谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just you trying to talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.61,0:08:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事情我们得谈谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things we need to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事情你必须学\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things that you need to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:04.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么了  你是...你是在怪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? Do you-- do you blame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:14.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的在怪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you actually blame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:18.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的左臂举过头顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise your left arm above your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.54,0:09:23.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做不到  告诉我为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't. Tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:25.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:32.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和这件事没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.00,0:09:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  他是你的朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, is he your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:55.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,板子可以后搭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got some panels to put up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.53,0:09:57.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们可以先种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we don't have to wait to start growing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会累得腰酸腿疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be some sore backs and tired feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦劳作就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you know you've put in a hard day's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.77,0:10:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在几里外的一个育苗场里找到了好几箱种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found crates of these at a nursery just a few miles out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.77,0:10:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西红柿  胡萝卜  什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomatoes, carrots, you name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以在这里种\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can plant them right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只需要完成扩张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need to finish the expansion
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:28.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且把墙建起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the wall needs to go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷吉希望这个社区能壮大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reg wanted this community to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.97,0:10:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是这么希望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.89,0:10:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在改变主意了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has that changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:45.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里所有人都是因为你才在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone that's here is here because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.62,0:10:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得让他们看到你的心还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to show them you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:02.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说那让我爽歪歪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hams my biscuits is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.03,0:11:05.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且根据体积计算\N{\fnArial\fs30}And going by cubic feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是扩张区中最大的一栋建筑物\N{\fnArial\fs30}the biggest building in the expansion
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:08.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们却要把它浪费在一座教堂上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna waste it on a church.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那些长椅拆掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take out the benches,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:10.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里就可以变成一间实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could be a lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:11.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者一个车间\N{\fnArial\fs30}a machine shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.51,0:11:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少可以变成一间超赞的游戏室\N{\fnArial\fs30}very least a sweet-ass game room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.51,0:11:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙内房产在这里是非常珍贵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walled-in real estate is at a premium here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:17.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神棍不应该有优先权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thumpers just shouldn't get dibs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以共用教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe we share the church, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天做不同的用途\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do all that stuff on different days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你爽歪歪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hams my biscuits?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爽歪歪  我只听到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hams my biscuits. That's all I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:30.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全不知道你之后说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I have no idea what you said after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我说根据体积...  -我开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Going by cubic feet... - I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:36.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧  丹娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay, Dana?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.81,0:11:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我叫丹妮斯  -丹妮斯  不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Denise. - Denise, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:43.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是新任医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the new doctor now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:46.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿阿司匹林做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the aspirin for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:47.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是医生吗  -那你是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a doctor? - Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前听说过你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}heard that story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.76,0:11:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair play.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:11:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  其实我有点紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm a little nervous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:11:59.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是心理医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.97,0:12:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,读医学院那会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to med school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本打算当外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was even gonna be a surgeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.16,0:12:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但结果惊恐发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}but after the panic attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从此便对心理学感兴趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got really interested in psychology.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想让你们别对我抱太大期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm really trying to lower expectations here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.07,0:12:18.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金  闭嘴  她能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene, shut up. She can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全镇只有我一个人能上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all this town's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:22.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮特不想我干这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete didn't want me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:24.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我却来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm here now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:28.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过还是会时不时想吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I only kind of want to throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你拿阿司匹林做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why the aspirin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.07,0:12:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和尤金正在搭建另一座哨塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene and I were working on a platform for another guard tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点头晕  毕竟头痛还没有全好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a little dizzy. You know, I still get headaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.46,0:12:39.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐吧  我帮你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, I'll take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.09,0:12:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的第一位患者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my first patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:51.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点小毛病  我保证医不死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with that symptom, I'm pretty sure I can't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.03,0:12:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非有类似血肿什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it is possible if you miss,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有检查出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, a hematoma or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.15,0:13:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.33,0:13:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.23,0:13:27.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我跟迪安娜告密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard what I told Deanna about your group.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你  和你们团队无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}not you or your group.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我如今醒悟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:40.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在教堂的时候  我不让你教我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to teach me back at my church.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我想学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm ready to learn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该把这个想法告诉大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you need to tell everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三点左右过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come by around 3:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:05.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先从砍刀学起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll start with the machete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.51,0:15:22.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理查兹  发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richards. What's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:27.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:50.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从楼上看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw from upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们正从四周突袭进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming in from all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须留在这保护朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stay here and keep Judith safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-求你别走  -我必须去找罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please don't go. - I have to go find Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:02.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我马上就回来  好吗  -妈  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna be right back, okay? - Mom, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.97,0:16:06.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你藏到衣橱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go put yourself in the closet
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,锁好门栓  就像我教你的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you close the latch just like I showed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么不敲门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有钥匙  不想让那些人拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have these. Didn't want them to have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:16.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanted to say good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.15,0:17:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好后门  看到他们过来就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, watch the back door. Tell me if you see them coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我要走了  -你不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not staying. - You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:23.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下  帮我一起保护朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down. You're helping me protect Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:25.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不能踏进这房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not getting inside this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不许\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna let them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.41,0:17:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到他们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.41,0:17:43.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只不过是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方太大了  保护不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is too big to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.67,0:17:51.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盲点太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are too many blind spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:54.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们才能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we were able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.25,0:17:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙没拦住他们  但是他们会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got in the walls, but they're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.75,0:18:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.22,0:18:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.67,0:18:16.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  请别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please. Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.63,0:19:10.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  求你了  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please. Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.99,0:19:16.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.63,0:19:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.31,0:20:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快啊  快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.43,0:21:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,霍莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:06.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备手术台\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need the operating table prepped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她失血很多  快  快  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's lost a lot of blood. Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闯进来多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people are out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, there's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.73,0:21:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗西塔  你知道怎么静脉注射吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita, you know how to stick an IV?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来  给我纱带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it. Here, hand me tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么响汽笛了  到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the air horn? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我得去帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I need to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我必须试试  -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to try. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:25.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹妮斯  我也必须过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denise, I'm gonna have to go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:28.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.19,0:21:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你挥舞锤子都会头晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got dizzy swinging a hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.93,0:21:31.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须有人看守住这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's got to guard this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.11,0:21:32.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你能行的  -我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can handle it. - I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.77,0:21:33.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also believe my services
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.92,0:21:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我待在这里最有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be best rendered right very here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.29,0:21:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -我认为此时此刻...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I also believe my services--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.95,0:21:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  你在这很安全  走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! You're safe here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.91,0:22:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.58,0:22:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一伙人  闯进了墙内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone, a group, they got inside the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.39,0:22:20.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在大肆屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.66,0:22:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.88,0:22:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.54,0:22:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:22:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想快点死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.26,0:22:59.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是慢点死\N{\fnArial\fs30}or slow?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.85,0:23:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.67,0:23:05.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是慢点死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna be slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.51,0:23:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能阻止他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.56,0:23:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-其他人回来了吗  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The others back? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们正在行动  -他们现在就动手了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's happening out there. - They're doing it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.85,0:23:24.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不得不动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人没有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people don't have guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.50,0:23:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能阻止他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.85,0:23:30.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要是有枪  就会用\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they had guns, they'd be using them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.47,0:23:31.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到我的话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.38,0:23:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得抢先到达军械库\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get to the armory before they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.91,0:23:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们快点  说不定能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we keep moving, this might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.30,0:23:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没必要杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然有必要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.30,0:23:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.93,0:23:49.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得赶到军械库  我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get to the armory and I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.25,0:23:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:23:58.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.51,0:24:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.22,0:24:02.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.05,0:24:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.82,0:24:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能进去  我没有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go in there. I don't have a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.67,0:24:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道怎么战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.82,0:24:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I go inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.20,0:24:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会变成你们的累赘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just be another person who's got to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.06,0:24:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我能为里面的人做的最好的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best thing that I can do for everyone in there
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.33,0:24:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是待在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to stay out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.14,0:24:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-保护好她  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep her safe. - I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.94,0:24:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.83,0:24:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在内出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's bleeding internally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.16,0:25:00.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许切到了股动脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably severed her femoral artery.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.09,0:25:02.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.98,0:25:05.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  切到了动脉  能治好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so the artery's severed. Can it be fixed?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.23,0:25:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外科医生也许可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe by a surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.88,0:25:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你本来要成为外科医生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna be a surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.44,0:25:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.92,0:25:12.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她保护着这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was protecting this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.18,0:25:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她守护着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was guarding us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.20,0:25:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们在这里的原因  照顾彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're here, for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.24,0:25:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你害怕了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.50,0:25:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎  救救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. Help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.84,0:25:24.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.58,0:25:26.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.85,0:25:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想当一个懦夫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to be a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.33,0:25:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.28,0:25:43.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一根束腹带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need an abdominal binder.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.47,0:25:44.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要把刀拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna pull the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.67,0:25:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.44,0:26:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.29,0:26:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.60,0:26:15.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你别杀我  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't kill me, man. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.91,0:26:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你救救我  我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, please. My leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.00,0:26:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.58,0:26:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.33,0:26:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.46,0:26:43.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.28,0:26:48.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.41,0:27:01.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.15,0:27:03.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈  你在家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.23,0:27:14.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,锁起来  勇敢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock it. Be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.16,0:27:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别进来  罗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay outside, Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.31,0:27:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.76,0:28:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好  蚜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good catch, Aphid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.64,0:28:46.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.16,0:28:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别管他了  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave him. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.12,0:28:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蚜虫  从哪拿的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Aphid, where'd you get the gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.89,0:29:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.92,0:29:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你别杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.12,0:30:04.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  还有人在这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Anybody else down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.92,0:30:08.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-奥利维亚  -没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Olivia! - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.75,0:30:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没了  就我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.23,0:30:17.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.76,0:30:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.99,0:30:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一走你就守住我身后的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You barricade that door behind me once I leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.18,0:30:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道怎么开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how to shoot a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.55,0:30:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.27,0:30:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手指扣扳机  对准那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finger here. Aim there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.02,0:30:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有敌人进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them comes through that door,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.21,0:30:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一直扣扳机  直到他们倒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}you squeeze and you don't stop till they're on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.22,0:30:48.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的招数是哪儿学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you learn how to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.54,0:30:51.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个做奶酪的人教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a cheese maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.16,0:31:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是在解放你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're freeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.34,0:31:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.39,0:31:07.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们得知道  人们不再属于这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to know, people don't belong here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.47,0:31:20.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-卡萝尔  -玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carol? - Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.28,0:31:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-给  -我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - I--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.29,0:31:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不大会用枪  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not very good with guns. I--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.86,0:31:31.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.80,0:32:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.81,0:32:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你住在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.76,0:32:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.53,0:32:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的伙伴有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people have guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.68,0:32:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的伙伴没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.44,0:32:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能正端着步枪瞄准你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may be aiming rifles at you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.07,0:33:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼睛盯着瞄准具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes at the scopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.58,0:33:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手指扣着扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fingers on the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.57,0:33:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,砰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.51,0:33:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们随时会开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna happen any second now
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.82,0:33:13.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你们离开这里  再也别回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you get the hell out of here and you don't ever come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.66,0:33:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们继续选择这种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep choosing this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.12,0:33:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迟早要送命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.21,0:33:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我们选择的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.31,0:36:24.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒啊  霍莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.57,0:36:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹妮斯  你尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denise, you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.50,0:36:59.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.79,0:37:03.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去看看外面结束了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go see if it's over out there
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.11,0:37:04.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.18,0:37:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你们都走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please go, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.49,0:37:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧  但我只是  -好  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, but I just-- - Good. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.02,0:37:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I was gonna say is...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.93,0:37:28.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得破坏她的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure you get her brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.32,0:37:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened today,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.24,0:37:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面就是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what it's like out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.44,0:37:46.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.16,0:37:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you--
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.31,0:37:52.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道世界是那样的  还怎么活着啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you just live knowing that's the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.38,0:37:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了这个团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}This group,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.04,0:38:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了亚伯拉罕  还有这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham, and this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.79,0:38:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确保你有值得为之牺牲的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you got something worth dying for.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.10,0:38:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还活着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.18,0:38:35.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并非所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.57,0:38:53.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.86,0:38:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.14,0:39:09.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(无论如何都要活下去)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.45,0:41:08.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你狠不下心  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.80,0:41:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该狠心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.17,0:41:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
